					"content": "#荣誉骑士{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SISTERA]}，谢谢你帮可莉的忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
