					"nextDialogs": [
						400110705,
						400110706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭芭拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110705,
					"content": "好敏锐的感知力。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110707
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400110707,
					"content": "说得我都不好意思了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭芭拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110708,
					"content": "可这附近只有那个没反应的稻妻机械而已呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110709,
					"content": "难道是在纪念它？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭芭拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110710,
					"content": "或许，它也曾做出过值得他人纪念的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110711,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭芭拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110712,
					"content": "我们所见到的这些布设，足以证明这片海域中有人类存在过。可光凭这些，无法推导究竟是怎样的人类文明。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110713,
					"content": "迄今为止我们也没有见到任何人类或是人类的墓冢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110714,
					"content": "琴团长，可莉去那边看看可以吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110715,
					"content": "可以，务必注意安全。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110716,
					"content": "嗯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "可莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110717,
					"content": "这片海岛上究竟有多少秘密？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110718
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400110718,
					"content": "可莉还小，比较缺乏危机感，但旅行者，我希望我们都能清醒地了解现状。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110719,
					"content": "坦白说，一开始我以为那封信只是恶作剧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110720,
					"content": "我们也这么想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110721,
					"content": "我也是，可会是谁给这样的小孩子寄恶作剧信件呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭芭拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110722,
					"content": "知道这座岛屿的人本就是少数，引导我们解开机关更是布局巧妙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110723,
					"content": "说不定，这些不是恶作剧而是谋划已久的陷阱。我们绝对不能掉以轻心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400110724
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 400110724,
					"content": "芭芭拉姐姐！",
